cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "DOZZ: a Lean 4 formalization of the Kupiainen–Rhodes–Vargas proof of the DOZZ formula"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of the theorem of
  Kupiainen, Rhodes and Vargas that the three-point structure constants of
  Liouville conformal field theory on the Riemann sphere, defined through the
  Gaussian free field and Gaussian multiplicative chaos, are given by the
  DOZZ formula; together with the identification of the reflection
  coefficient, the construction and moment theory of Gaussian multiplicative
  chaos and the extended Seiberg bounds of David, Kupiainen, Rhodes and
  Vargas, and the BPZ equations of Kupiainen, Rhodes and Vargas.
  The library and the comparator solutions contain no sorry and no custom axiom.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
